      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "custom-declaration-class"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Custom Declaration\n\nA Declaration node whose editor covers every field a Declaration holds: identity, kind, Surfaces, authority, settings and address.\n\nBind a graph's Declaration to this class with a class binding whose key is `custom-declaration`. Its card then shows the graph's own name, kind, version and description, and its editor is the complete form.\n\nThe editor is the same one the Declaration Template carries."
        }
      }
    },
